Poet CLI toolchain for VibeScript (vvibe-0.1)

Usage:
  poet repl [--grant <capability>]...  Interactive REPL; default grants: none
  poet format <file>  Format a .vibe file
  poet lint <file>    Run static analysis checks on a .vibe file
  poet eval <file>    Evaluate a .vibe file and print result
  poet help           Show this help message
  poet studio --diagnostic-new-source [--grant <capability>]...  Native Aether Studio
